 
                          s . p . i . r . i . s
 
                strikes with a /X-xim status door called
 
                             HeavenStat v1.0
 
                  coded by iCE for fun 26th July 1996
 
 
- What is it?
 
             a GREAT status door for /X and maybe S!X, dunno. Nice design
             and many features, and a fucking cool fade out anim. The anim
             may look lame from the sysops side but you should see it from
             the users side (!). To bad /X don't display some ansi commands
             proper.
 
             I included one version without the anim too, for sysops wanna
             have speed.
 
             heavenstat.xim      -> without anim
             heavenstatextra.xim -> anim included
 
- How to install.
 
             well, hope you can figure it out yourself ;).
 
